--- !u!114 &295927311
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 295927310}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ff9ca52c25967ee44a75573485242334, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Fizyka.DemoHud
  title: "06 \xB7 AddTorque \u2013 tryby ForceMode"
  description: "rb.AddTorque(wektor, ForceMode) \u2013 jak AddForce, ale dla obrotu.
    Zamiast masy liczy si\u0119 <b>moment bezw\u0142adno\u015Bci I</b> (Unity liczy
    go automatycznie z masy i kszta\u0142tu collider\xF3w \u2013 wida\u0107 go jako
    I(y)).\n\u2022 <b>Force</b> \u2013 moment si\u0142y [N\xB7m] przez 1 s: \u03B5
    = \u03C4 / I\n\u2022 <b>Acceleration</b> \u2013 przyspieszenie k\u0105towe [rad/s\xB2]
    przez 1 s, ignoruje I\n\u2022 <b>Impulse</b> \u2013 impuls momentu [N\xB7m\xB7s]:
    \u0394\u03C9 = L / I\n\u2022 <b>VelocityChange</b> \u2013 natychmiastowa zmiana
    \u03C9 [rad/s], ignoruje I\n\nWarto\u015B\u0107: 2 wok\xF3\u0142 osi Y. Prz\xF3d:
    ma\u0142y klocek 1\xD71\xD71, m = 1 kg (I \u2248 0,17). Ty\u0142: du\u017Cy 2\xD72\xD72,
    m = 4 kg (I \u2248 2,67).\nMa\u0142y: Force/Impulse \u2192 12 rad/s, Acceleration/VelocityChange
    \u2192 2 rad/s.\nDu\u017Cy: Force/Impulse \u2192 0,75 rad/s, Acceleration/VelocityChange
    \u2192 2 rad/s.\n\nmaxAngularVelocity podniesiono do 100 rad/s, Angular Damping
    = 0, pozycje zamro\u017Cone (Constraints)."
  sceneHint: "<b>Spacja</b> \u2013 AddTorque we wszystkich trybach"
  freeCameraControls: 1
  descriptionPanel: {fileID: 1307409130}
  titleText: {fileID: 1348827458}
  descriptionText: {fileID: 1879550773}
  hintText: {fileID: 1659365167}
  logPanel: {fileID: 16650236}
  logText: {fileID: 276170390}
  labelsRoot: {fileID: 224799385}
